{"content_hash": "07783eb4128ff51a", "version_id": 881, "article_id": 89, "level_code": "en_a1", "lang": "en", "level": 1, "level_label": "A1 入门", "title": "Nvidia app update adds DLSS to 19 games", "title_zh": "英伟达应用更新，19款游戏加入DLSS", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ithome", "source_url": "https://www.ithome.com/1/023/068.htm", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1719763031152-e9a4bcb12a3e?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Nnx8YXBwJTIwZGxzc3xlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzkzOTI5NDkwfDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Indra Projects on Unsplash", "author": "Indra Projects", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@indraprojects?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-close-up-of-a-computer-screen-with-many-different-app-icons-S4QZnvK5Mvg?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(9, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(47, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "0171d0c216a0"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-06", "word_count": 80, "reading_minutes": 0.4, "lead": "Nvidia has a new version of its app. It helps 19 games look and run better. Six other games also get new settings.", "lead_zh": "英伟达推出了新版应用。它能帮19款游戏画面更好、运行更顺。另外6款游戏也有了新的设置。", "preview": "The new app is version 11.0.9.585. It adds DLSS settings for 19 games. One of them is PUBG: BATTLEGROUNDS.", "preview_zh": "新版应用的版本号是11.0.9.585。它为19款游戏加入了DLSS设置。其中一款是《绝地求生：大逃杀》。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 864, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/89/en_a1.mp3", "duration": 32.775, "size_bytes": 197568, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 97, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/89/en_a1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 33.5, "size_bytes": 201888, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 97, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/89/en_a1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/89/en_a1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 35.875, "size_bytes": 216144, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 97, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/89/en_a1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/89/en_a1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 31.55, "size_bytes": 190224, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 97, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/89/en_a1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/89/en_a1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 33.4, "size_bytes": 201312, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 97, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/89/en_a1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@feabd64/content/data/versions/881.json", "paragraphs": ["The new app is version 11.0.9.585. It adds DLSS settings for 19 games. One of them is PUBG: BATTLEGROUNDS.", "Six games get a 'best settings' profile. These games include AION 2 and Aniimo. The app picks good settings for you.", "You can find these options in the app. Look under Graphics, then Program Settings. Then open Driver Settings.", "Before this, Nvidia released two other versions. One added DLSS 4.5 support. The other added new data about CPU speed and heat."], "paragraphs_zh": ["新版应用的版本号是11.0.9.585。它为19款游戏加入了DLSS设置。其中一款是《绝地求生：大逃杀》。", "有6款游戏获得了“最佳设置”配置文件。这些游戏包括《永恒之塔2》和《伊莫》。应用会替你选好合适的设置。", "你可以在应用里找到这些选项。先点“图形”，再点“程序设置”，然后打开“驱动程序设置”。", "在这之前，英伟达还发布了另外两个版本。一个加入了DLSS 4.5支持。另一个加入了CPU频率和温度等新数据。"], "body": "The new app is version 11.0.9.585. It adds DLSS settings for 19 games. One of them is PUBG: BATTLEGROUNDS.\n\nSix games get a 'best settings' profile. These games include AION 2 and Aniimo. The app picks good settings for you.\n\nYou can find these options in the app. Look under Graphics, then Program Settings. Then open Driver Settings.\n\nBefore this, Nvidia released two other versions. One added DLSS 4.5 support. The other added new data about CPU speed and heat.", "body_zh": "新版应用的版本号是11.0.9.585。它为19款游戏加入了DLSS设置。其中一款是《绝地求生：大逃杀》。\n\n有6款游戏获得了“最佳设置”配置文件。这些游戏包括《永恒之塔2》和《伊莫》。应用会替你选好合适的设置。\n\n你可以在应用里找到这些选项。先点“图形”，再点“程序设置”，然后打开“驱动程序设置”。\n\n在这之前，英伟达还发布了另外两个版本。一个加入了DLSS 4.5支持。另一个加入了CPU频率和温度等新数据。", "text": "The new app is version 11.0.9.585. It adds DLSS settings for 19 games. One of them is PUBG: BATTLEGROUNDS. Six games get a 'best settings' profile. These games include AION 2 and Aniimo. The app picks good settings for you. You can find these options in the app. Look under Graphics, then Program Settings. Then open Driver Settings. Before this, Nvidia released two other versions. One added DLSS 4.5 support. The other added new data about CPU speed and heat.", "vocab": [{"word": "app", "pos": "noun", "zh": "应用", "note": "application 的简称", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "version", "pos": "noun", "zh": "版本", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "game", "pos": "noun", "zh": "游戏", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "add", "pos": "verb", "zh": "添加", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "settings", "pos": "noun", "zh": "设置", "note": "常用复数", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "find", "pos": "verb", "zh": "找到", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "release", "pos": "verb", "zh": "发布", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "support", "pos": "noun", "zh": "支持", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-06T01:44:48.078996", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.35, "sm": 275, "em": 349, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "new", "s": 0.35, "e": 0.537, "s